//
// A Control-Center header button (design artifacts: panels `.hbtn`): a 30px
// circle carrying only a glyph — no resting background, the hover wash the
// interaction chain paints is the whole affordance.
//
// Presentational: the handler goes on a wrapping `Stack` at the use site,
// because these three buttons (edit · power · settings) each mean something
// different and a shared component must not decide that.

Component HeaderIconButton {
    props: {
        icon: Str,
    }
    Circle { size: 30
        Icon { symbol: $props.icon, size: 14 }
            .fg(label)
    }
    .hitSlop(8)
}
